                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty cool beat em up sidescroller that convinced me immediately by its lovely pixel art and the typical beat m up fight mechanic.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jx3fpyTAymo&t=423s\n\nActually very rare in the genre. It's smooth, it has a well-designed combot mechanic. So nothing to complain about. And the overall review rating is very positive.\n\nOn the not so bright side, music is generic and a bit boring and it seems to be a bit short. I will update on this point when I finished the game. I mostly need longer to finish a game than the average Steam gamer. Don't know why. ;D\n\nTotally recommend for the sale price of 2.99 EUR. Maybe even full price. But I have to test more.\n\n[i] Twitch Channel : https://www.twitch.tv/mrorange55\nYoutube Channel : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1UE5TPoF0HX0HVpF_E4uPQ/videos?view_as=subscriber [/i]",
